    "balance_over_run_rate_months": 36.09874080064362,
    "not_on_the_dashboard": "At the current run rate the commitment outlives the contract by ~7 months, i.e. roughly 540k of the 3.17M would go unconsumed by the term end; on the slower since-inception average burn it is ~963k. Rob chose 'burn chart only, no conclusion' on 2026-08-19, so this projection lives here and in his notes and appears in NO panel description. A test enforces that."
